+
+## 8. Database Property Types
+
+### All Supported Property Types
+
+| Type | API Key | Creatable | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Title | `"title": {}` | Yes | Exactly one per database (required) |
+| Rich Text | `"rich_text": {}` | Yes | Multi-line text |
